WEBVTT

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.170
Summer has begun!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.090
Today is the day the Leaf 
Village pool opens.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.990
It's finally time.

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:43.660
Intense summer training
right at the poolside!

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:46.420
I'm on fire!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.460
Isn't it hot enough for you already?

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.810
What're you doing, Neji?!

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.100
You're a man! 
Change your clothes like one!

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:06.060
Like that!

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.440
That's almost too manly!

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.030
Check it out. This is the 
shiny new swimsuit I bought...

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.120
...especially for training 
on days like this!

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.860
Poolside training means it's 
time for the Sexy Jutsu!

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:23.990
I've got a killer swimsuit ready, too!

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.500
I'll show you guys.

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:38.170
I can't let you two beat me!

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.580
They're so loud.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.650
What the heck are the 
guys doing over there?

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:47.590
No way! Sakura would never 
wear a suit like that!

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.060
What about this?

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.390
Shells aren't a swimsuit.

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:55.190
All right, how's this one?

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.900
Knock it off!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.820
S-Sorry...

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:12.500
<b>Women</b>

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:12.500
<b>Locker Room</b>

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:10.410
So that's what she picked out.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.090
It's more plain than I expected.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:14.920
What the...

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:24.930
<b>The Pool's Finally Open!</b>

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:28.770
There's no water in the pool!

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.690
Guy Sensei, what's going on?!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:38.530
Well, every year Kakashi's supposed
to fill it with a water style jutsu.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.940
Oh, no! Is Kakashi Sensei hurt?!

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.830
Kakashi...

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.470
He left this letter and 
disappeared without a trace.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:54.210
I'm off on a journey to find the latest 
book in the "Make-Out" series.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.040
That's all?!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.920
The "Make-Out" series of books...

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.800
...is Kakashi Sensei's favorite 
literary collection.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.260
It's a little risqué and 
geared towards adults.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:06.340
Apparently every bookstore 
in the village was sold out.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:09.600
He's already been gone a week.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.230
Does it really take that 
long to find a book?

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:20.400
Our plan to ruin the pool 
opening worked flawlessly.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.400
<b>"Make-Out Pooltime"</b>

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.400
<b>First in the new
"Make-Out Swimming" series</b>

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:25.320
Ah-ha, so they bought every copy.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:29.850
T-This is intense...

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.050
A co-ed chicken fight wearing 
only shell swimsuits...

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.290
Suddenly, she fell into his―

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.420
This is no time for casual reading!

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.450
My glasses, my glasses...

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.570
My apologies!

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:47.190
The main phase of the plan starts now.

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:50.390
While Lee and the rest are angry 
about the pool being empty,

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.490
we'll lure them into...

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:55.170
...the Super Happy Orochi-Pool Park!

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:01.710
I'll have Manda set up to 
look like a huge water slide,

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.870
and when he blindly leaps in to ride it,

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:07.070
Lee and his little friends 
will be swallowed whole!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.450
But, Lord Orochimaru,

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:12.320
how are we going to avoid 
drawing their suspicion?

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.500
Leave that to me.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.220
Excuse me, I'm from 
the Orochi Newspaper.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.110
Would you care to sign up for 
a trial monthly subscription?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.240
It comes with a free detergent sample,

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:28.440
and discount tickets to the 
Super Happy Orochi-Pool Park.

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:32.140
Discount tickets, not free tickets...

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.040
Hello there, I'm from 
the Orochi Newspaper!

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.190
Oh, no thank you.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.020
I already get the Mongoose Times.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.100
They totally brushed him off.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.300
I should've offered more incentives.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.070
I don't think that was the problem.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:52.220
Anyway, I'm making a last-minute 
change to the pool opening plans!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:55.080
I want all of you to figure 
out a way to solve this!

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:56.750
Us?

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.170
Yes!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.750
Work together and fill 
this pool to the top!

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:03.340
I see...

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.920
It'll be water-style training. 
Two birds with one stone!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.680
How troublesome...

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:13.370
But none of us can really 
use water style techniques.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.100
We'll have to try anyway!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.350
Water Style, Raging River Blast!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.060
There's nothing raging about that!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.730
Water Style, Wild Water Wave!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.740
That's just drool!

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:32.280
Water Style, Waterfall Basin Jutsu!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.870
That's an octopus jar!

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.210
Water Style, Water Bullet Jutsu!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.460
Wait, I need to fill it first...

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:42.460
This is pointless!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.870
Don't even think about it!

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.550
Shikamaru, think of something.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.550
It'll be troublesome,

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.410
but round up Nakamura from Team Two,

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.030
Yoshimatsu from Team Three,

00:06:56.030 --> 00:07:00.890
Mizuno from Team Four, 
and Fushihara from Team Five.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.230
Who the heck are they?

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:07.060
Oh, yeah. People say whenever they 
get together it always rains!

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:07.940
They're rain men?

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.950
You wanna fill the pool with rain?

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.660
That'll take forever.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.750
The pool's gonna be closed 
forever at this rate.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.010
We can't just quit.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.910
Let me handle this.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.670
Bushy-Brows, you can 
use water style moves?

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.920
Water Style, Six Pack Jutsu!

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:39.040
That's not a water style jutsu! 
You're just sweating!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:43.520
I dried up before I 
could fill the pool...

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.540
He used up all his water!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:49.630
No one wants to swim in a
sweat pool! That's disgusting!

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.360
T-True...

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.360
No, wait!

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:58.370
If it was Sakura's pure, 
sparkling white sweat drops,

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.510
I think we'd be okay!

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:02.970
Sakura, if you―

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:08.460
Looks like they can't get 
the pool filled themselves.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.550
This is my chance to try again.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:15.080
I guess we'll have to give 
up on the pool after all...

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.850
<b>Lottery</b>

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.850
Step right up, step right up!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.860
Lord Orochimaru...

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:22.310
We'll be fine this time!

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:25.350
Fifth prize is a pool pass!

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.140
If I win, we'll be able to swim!

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.760
See? They're walking 
right into my trap.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.570
But they don't have 
any tickets for sale.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:35.910
Lord Orochimaru...

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:38.830
Aw, this was our big chance, too...

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.420
Oh, well.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.850
Hold it right there!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.890
I'll give you boys a free spin 
because I'm such a nice guy!

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.170
Really?!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.150
Here I go.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.490
Sorry kid, you only get 
a four-pack of tissues.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.860
Why did you set it up 
with a booby prize?

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:01.060
Darn it.

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:04.850
Wait, I'll give you one more!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:07.510
I'll do it.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.100
The grand prize!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:15.240
Nine days and seven nights in 
beautiful Hawaii, congratulations!

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:19.120
Why did you put in a grand prize, too?!

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.330
Wait, take one more spin!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.290
Let me do this one.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.130
There it is! Fifth prize!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.090
Discount tickets to the Super 
Happy Orochi-Pool Park!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.050
Discount tickets again?!

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:37.200
I would've preferred free passes,

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.250
but a discount is better than nothing.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:44.270
Perhaps I was wrong to think 
opening the pool would be easy.

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:46.810
There's only one option left.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.150
I'll have to use a forbidden jutsu.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:50.810
Forbidden jutsu?

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.010
What is it?

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:56.320
Water Style,

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.160
Hula Dance of the Ninja 
Hounds, Final Step!

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.330
I am a ninja who cannot use ninjutsu.

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.830
Today is Christmas,

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:11.790
but I've failed the jounin 
exam, I've lost my home...

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.270
Nejirush...

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.230
I'm so tired...

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.720
So sleepy...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:42.240
How is this a water style technique?

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.680
Well, I thought it really 
tugged at the heartstrings,

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.370
and we could fill the pool 
with everyone's tears.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:51.330
That's impossible! 
You can't fill a pool with tears!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.190
What a sad tale!

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:03.810
And so the pool was finally filled.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:07.980
Anyone gonna swim?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:08.730
No way!

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:12.620
But it was so gross no one went in.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:16.580
And apparently Orochimaru's 
a big ol' softie!

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:21.400
Waaah, waaah, waaah...

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:31.970
It's nearly time for the 
Leaf Village Star Festival.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.680
Lee and the gang are
hanging papers with...

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.340
...their wishes on some 
ornamental bamboo grass―

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.990
Huh? Socks?

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.230
Santa, Santa, 
please bring me a 3DS...

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.050
Hey, now.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:46.600
Of course D is for determination 
and S is for supreme!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.020
Quit confusing people!

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:49.980
Fortunes, too?

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.360
Just my luck, getting "great misfortune" 
at the start of summer vacation.

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.200
Should I get some garlands, too?

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:58.940
This is the Star Festival. 
Get your holidays straight!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:08.910
<b>The Super Happy Orochi-Pool Park!</b>

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.800
Once upon a time,

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.430
the gods of the stars sent a 
beautiful woman down to Earth...

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:18.340
...to work on a loom, 
and named her "Orihime."

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.480
Orihime was a very skilled weaver,

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:23.260
and spent her days weaving 
new kimonos for the gods.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.540
One day,

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:29.390
Orihime met a young cattle
rancher named Hikoboshi,

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.260
and the two fell in love.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:37.110
They were soon wed,

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:41.690
and lived happily in wedded bliss.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.970
Both soon stopped working altogether.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:49.100
With no Orihime, the gods' 
kimonos began to wear out.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:53.120
And with no Hikoboshi, 
the cows fell ill.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:59.750
Angered, the gods separated them on 
either side of the river of heaven,

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:04.800
allowing them to meet only 
once a year on July 7th.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.300
And so,

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.740
we throw them a big 
party every July 7th,

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.780
so they can focus on their work 
for the rest of the year.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:13.890
I see.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.400
The moral is, it was hard to maintain 
a long-distance relationship...

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.190
...before they invented cell phones.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.270
That wasn't the moral.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.060
Absence makes the heart grow fonder.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.970
When I close my eyes, 
I see you by my side.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.200
You're not helping!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.870
Then why do we write our 
wishes on these postcards?

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.140
W-Well...

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.870
<i>Yeah, why do we?</i>

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:36.730
Do you not know either, Guy Sensei?

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.240
At any rate!

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.260
The important thing is that you're...

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:44.250
...not writing your wish so just 
anyone can make it come true!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.010
He's avoiding the question.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:48.840
A wish is your own personal goal,

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.220
and you must be the one 
to make it a reality.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.820
He just made that up.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:53.980
Definitely.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:56.720
You must make your wish come true!

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.650
He fell for it!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.780
And so, my friends!

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:01.610
Bring everything you've 
got, go out there,

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.530
and make the wish you've written 
on your card come true!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.650
That is your training!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.330
And so, Lee and the gang began 
slowly working on this "training."

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.680
This is my wish!

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:21.840
What do you think you're carving?!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:26.010
Ah, yes. Konohamaru's wish is to 
become the youngest Hokage ever.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.710
Food goes in, teeth come down!

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:32.630
Eat, eat, eat!

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:36.160
And Choji's wish is all-you-can-eat 
Korean barbecue.

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:39.730
It's already come true, 
now he just needs to pay.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.070
If you can't pay, you wash dishes!

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:43.900
Yes, sir.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:49.060
Shikamaru's wish is probably to spend
the whole day doing nothing.

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:52.240
I don't think there's a wish 
that's more easily granted.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.910
This isn't a wish. It's nothing at all.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:57.920
I wonder where Hinata is...

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.160
What's you wish?

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:03.170
I-I don't have one.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.290
"I wish to be better friends with Hinata."

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:08.050
It's nothing, nothing at all!

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:09.660
What about you, Tenten?

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:14.900
Oh, I wished to become a strong,
beautiful ninja like Lady Tsunade.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.210
You'll be fine!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.060
You've already got better skin, 
for starters!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:23.530
Lady Tsunade's skin is all dried out,

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:25.280
and she cakes on all that makeup―

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.080
You say something?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.950
N-No...

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.490
Oh? I thought you were 
spreading rumors about me.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:32.230
Perish the thought...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.140
So, what's your wish, Lee?

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:40.270
Me?

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.710
I wished to...

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.130
...have a Star Festival date
 at the pool with Sakura!

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:52.590
Party of three's up!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.130
One large yakisoba.

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:56.070
No ginger on this one.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.000
We're doing big business, huh?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:01.400
It's because I posted flyers everywhere.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:08.320
Our main targets have been 
caught in our net, too.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.450
What're we doing at the pool?

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:13.960
Determining its suitability 
for a date, of course!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.910
I want to practice the perfect date,

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.430
so Sakura will have as 
much fun as possible.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:22.640
Preparing for a date?

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.020
Interesting.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:26.450
I'll leave him alone for today,

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:30.510
and humiliate him on his date 
in front of the girl instead!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.010
<b>Make-Out Pooltime</b>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.010
<b>First in the new 
Make-Out Swimming series</b>

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:38.010
The secrets of a good pool date
are written in Make-Out Pooltime.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.970
Rule One:

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.740
Be careful with the seaweed 
when you're eating yakisoba.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.200
That's rule one?

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:47.550
Even if she gets a piece 
caught in her teeth,

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:49.230
you can't say anything.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:54.990
You must quickly and discreetly 
remove it for her with ninjutsu.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.650
I see, that's good advice.

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:01.730
Let's practice that one.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.580
Why me?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:06.500
There's no reason I need 
to wear the bikini...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.500
There we go.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.960
But I can't use ninjutsu.

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:13.460
Instead of discreet ninjutsu, 
I'll use discreet strikes.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.390
That's not discreet at all!

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.850
My teeth are gonna fall out!

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:20.810
I did it!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.800
Those accursed brats...

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:31.730
Endure. We'll destroy him on his date.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:35.800
I've mastered rule one 
of a good pool date.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:38.470
Oh, you're all here, too?

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:41.700
Who―

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.500
What's wrong? You're 
all making weird faces.

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:46.680
<i>L-Lady Tsunade...</i>

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:49.330
<i>The pool washed off her makeup...</i>

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:53.710
<i>I think we saw something 
we weren't supposed to...</i>

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.600
What is it?

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.610
Let's give Lady Tsunade a chance to fix
herself up and preserve her dignity.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:04.520
So the Star Festival's not 
like Christmas after all!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:06.210
She's done!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.420
Practicing for a date, huh?

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:11.310
Sounds fun.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.940
Why don't I teach you a few things?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.670
But...

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.320
Oh, come on.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.550
Doo-wop, disco, I'll teach 
you whatever you wanna know!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:24.200
No, I don't think a woman in 
her 50's who's still single...

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.610
...can really offer any relevant advice.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.400
U-Um...

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.790
Lee...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.700
I'll kill him...

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.520
Hang in there, Kabuto.

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:43.670
Get through today.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:47.020
We'll ruin his life on the date.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.730
Oh, you're here, too, Bushy-Brows?

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.400
Hello... Naruto...

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:57.440
They've got a huge twisty 
waterside over there!

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:00.660
It says it's over 100 meters 
long. I wanna ride it!

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:05.380
A slide... That brings us
to pool date rule two.

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:08.240
An embarrassing but happy accident,

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:10.420
when suits get pulled up, or fall off!

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:14.100
I don't wanna see your suit go anywhere.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:16.800
Let's see if it really works!

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:20.480
Shoot, if they find out the 
slide is really Manda...

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:21.970
W-Wait!

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:24.930
This is kind of a weird waterside...

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.520
No!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.330
Let's jump in!

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.390
Wait, you two!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:36.650
The slide's still being worked on!
 You can't ride it!

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.450
Are you all right, Lord Orochimaru?

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:51.300
That kid's going to pay...

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:52.630
Just wait...

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.670
I'll humiliate you so badly on your date,

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:57.460
your heart will be shattered!

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.050
The day of the Star Festival.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:07.620
<i>I've practiced the perfect poolside 
date for the Star Festival.</i>

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:10.110
<i>Now I just have to ask Sakura out.</i>

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:12.770
<i>There she is.</i>

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:14.410
<i>Time to man up.</i>

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.820
<i>Summon all your courage,</i>

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:21.220
<i>make your wish come true 
with your own two hands.</i>

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.310
Um, Sakura!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:25.530
Huh?

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:26.660
Hey!

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:28.080
Lee?

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.470
Sakura!

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.990
Can I talk to you about my 
wish for the Star Festival?

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:34.710
Your wish?

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.140
Actually, I, um...

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.870
I... Date...

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:41.220
Yes?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.120
I mean...

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:43.570
Here...

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:50.850
Well, my wish was to pass my
level three medical ninjutsu exam.

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.720
I'm on my way to the test site now.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:57.790
I've been so scared I'd fail,
I've put off taking it till now.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.730
But Guy Sensei helped 
me decide to go for it.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:03.280
I have to make my wish 
come true on my own!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:04.930
Sakura...

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.250
What about you, Lee?

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:09.790
My wish...

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.630
Um... My wish is...

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:14.870
Right!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:18.630
My wish was for your wish to come true!

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:23.320
So I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:25.770
You'll definitely pass!

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.100
Atta boy, Rock Lee.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:31.680
You truly are a man amongst men!

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.670
Meanwhile at the Orochi-Pool Park...

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.430
H-He's not coming...

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:43.940
L-Let's go home...

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:27.170
<b>The Warring Chef Triad
Time to Tone Down Guy-Sensei!</b>

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:24.940
Next week is "The Warring Chef Triad,"

00:23:24.940 --> 00:23:27.170
and "Time to Tone Down Guy-Sensei!"

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:29.510
Cooking? How troublesome...

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:31.510
All the guys say that.

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.940
So, Shikamaru, when you cook,

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:36.230
do you just throw everything together in a stew?

00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:38.310
That's too much work.

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:39.890
I just make the soup stock the day before,

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:41.790
measure out the ingredients in a measuring cup,

00:23:41.790 --> 00:23:44.190
and add a dash of the secret ingredient.

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:46.780
That sounds like a lot more work!
